A reminder for a day: "remind me on November 3". mem keeps it as a goal that
waits until that day, written as a day of the right year, and a later
session, still before the day, says what is coming up and when.

-- prompt --
Remind me on November 3 to renew the TLS certificate for api.acme.test.
-- prompt-new --
What have I asked you to remind me about, and when?
-- check --
turn 1 tool gnovm_run >= 1
cmd grep -q '2026-11-03' "$(find "$XDG_DATA_HOME" -path '*/mem/status.json' | head -1)"
answer last contains TLS
answer last matches (?i)(nov(ember)?\.? ?0?3\b|2026-11-03|11/0?3\b|\b3(rd)? (of )?nov)
